---
const controls = ["Review a prepared response", "Confirm the next customer action", "See what needs attention", "Keep the team aligned"];
---
<section class="business-control" aria-labelledby="control-title"><div class="container business-control__grid"><div class="business-control__panel" aria-label="Business control workflow"><div class="business-control__panel-head"><span>Business attention</span><strong>Four clear decisions</strong></div><ol>{controls.map((control,index) => <li><span>{String(index+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span><strong>{control}</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i></li>)}</ol></div><div class="business-control__copy"><p class="story-kicker">Your business stays in control</p><h2 id="control-title">Assistance when it helps. A person when it matters.</h2><p>Chakusa can prepare responses, organise follow-up, and run eligible automation. The business decides what is enabled, what needs approval, and when a team member should take over.</p><a href="/product#automation">See how automation fits <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>
